<title>USA: Zavalla ISD, Texas, won by Southwest Securities.</title>
<headline>Zavalla ISD, Texas, won by Southwest Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Southwest Securities said it won $1.200 million of Zavalla ISD, Texas, schoolhouse bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.49 percent.</p>
</text>
